  "decisions": [
    "Actual Info.plist lists en/ar and both Debug/Release consume it; OS per-app-language Settings is applicable, actual UI interaction not yet run.",
    "AppNavigator rejects top-level selection during active game and App hides tabs there. In-game real SettingsStore mutation is synthetic test input, not a normal UI journey.",
    "Observe LocalLayoutDirection inside actual provider/game; UIKit semantic direction alone is insufficient.",
    "Capture actual PartyAwareSession + canonical StateFlow references and canonical value internally, using identity-aware disposal; never export private canonical data/seed/roles.",
    "Whodunit stable intro and Mafia role-reveal avoid intentional timers/automatic transitions; background/foreground must use original Swift lifecycle path.",
    "Policy intentionally retains unmarked old internal AppleLanguages, excludes unsupported migration, and does not count a check as PASS.",
    "No production/test/config edits, builds, Gradle/Xcode/native/app launches, daemon stop, process signals, Git mutations, signing, or Store operations performed by reviewer."
